            <ArticleTitle>[Application of robots in stomatology].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>626-629</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Recently, the robot technology has been developed rapidly and the medical robot has been used in many clinical areas, especially in the field of stomatology. The application of robot in stomatology will break the traditional mode of treatment and bring a new technological revolution. This paper introduced the advantages, the current situation and the development prospect of applying robot in stomatology.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
